-5238-87a7-8727a3e0ad13"] ["answer-field-9c21dd7c-6896-5689-b43e-0b6480bc4997" :answer-field/choices "answer-8355179e-84d2-53eb-b5bb-6abf063bd798"] ["answer-field-9c21dd7c-6896-5689-b43e-0b6480bc4997" :answer-field/choices "answer-5afb7303-a034-559b-ab16-8b8311bec0af"] ["question-b521b5c1-2f07-5bb3-9c22-0775852024a2" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-9c21dd7c-6896-5689-b43e-0b6480bc4997"] [17592186096784 :knowledge-point/questions "question-b521b5c1-2f07-5bb3-9c22-0775852024a2"] ["question-648c2e1a-c875-5372-ad66-c0b63e6cb405" :question/id #uuid "648c2e1a-c875-5372-ad66-c0b63e6cb405"] ["question-648c2e1a-c875-5372-ad66-c0b63e6cb405" :question/math-academy-id "q-18760"] ["question-648c2e1a-c875-5372-ad66-c0b63e6cb405" :question/problem "Let $(a,b)$ be the solution of the following system. What is the value of $a+b?$\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}0.05a-0.2b=0.04 \\\\ 0.12a-1.2b=0.24\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-648c2e1a-c875-5372-ad66-c0b63e6cb405" :question/worked-solution "To get rid of the decimals, we multiply both equations by $100,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}0.05a-0.2b=0.04 & |\\times 100 \\\\ 0.12a-1.2b=0.24 & |\\times 100\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}5a-20b=4 \\\\ 12a-120b=24\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that if we multiply the first equation by $-2$ and divide the second equation by $3,$ we will get a $40b$ term in the first equation that can cancel with the $-40b$ term in the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}5a-20b=4 & |\\,\\times (-2) \\\\ 12a-120b=24 & |\\,÷3\\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}-10a+40b=-8 \\\\ 4a-40b=8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding the two equations eliminates the $b$-variable and allows us to solve for $a:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-10a+\\cancel{40b} & =-8 \\\\ 4a-\\cancel{40b} & =8 \\\\ (-10a+4a) & =(-8+8) \\\\ -6a & =0 \\\\ a & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can substitute $a=0$ into the equation $5a-20b=4$ to solve for $b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5a-20b & =4 \\\\ 5(0)-20b & =4 \\\\ -20b & =4 \\\\ b & =-\\frac{4}{20} \\\\ b & =-0.2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $a=0,\\,b=-0.2.$ So,\n\n$$\na+b=0+(-0.2)=-0.2.\n$$"] ["question-648c2e1a-c875-5372-ad66-c0b63e6cb405" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-a297791d-ebee-5b0c-89e6-af072a20920b" :answer-field/id #uuid "a297791d-ebee-5b0c-89e6-af072a20920b"] ["answer-4ae222cd-009b-5eaa-a3a5-11a212b109ca" :answer/id #uuid "4ae222cd-009b-5eaa-a3a5-11a212b109ca"] ["answer-4ae222cd-009b-5eaa-a3a5-11a212b109ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4ae222cd-009b-5eaa-a3a5-11a212b109ca" :answer/value "-0.2"] ["answer-8b7e78ed-ac31-5f29-8e01-0ec44695e0e4" :answer/id #uuid "8b7e78ed-ac31-5f29-8e01-0ec44695e0e4"] ["answer-8b7e78ed-ac31-5f29-8e01-0ec44695e0e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-8b7e78ed-ac31-5f29-8e01-0ec44695e0e4" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-5df4489a-0f0d-55e1-b4af-a317e094993e" :answer/id #uuid "5df4489a-0f0d-55e1-b4af-a317e094993e"] ["answer-5df4489a-0f0d-55e1-b4af-a317e094993e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5df4489a-0f0d-55e1-b4af-a317e094993e" :answer/value "0.2"] ["answer-4f925c03-7ab6-5520-8a1e-a5a9a717bba1" :answer/id #uuid "4f925c03-7ab6-5520-8a1e-a5a9a717bba1"] ["answer-4f925c03-7ab6-5520-8a1e-a5a9a717bba1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4f925c03-7ab6-5520-8a1e-a5a9a717bba1" :answer/value "1"] ["answer-ed9e94e3-0927-55e7-9927-3ea8b44e2b51" :answer/id #uuid "ed9e94e3-0927-55e7-9927-3ea8b44e2b51"] ["answer-ed9e94e3-0927-55e7-9927-3ea8b44e2b51" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ed9e94e3-0927-55e7-9927-3ea8b44e2b51" :answer/value "2"] ["answer-field-a297791d-ebee-5b0c-89e6-af072a20920b" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-a297791d-ebee-5b0c-89e6-af072a20920b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-a297791d-ebee-5b0c-89e6-af072a20920b" :answer-field/correct "answer-4ae222cd-009b-5eaa-a3a5-11a212b109ca"] ["answer-field-a297791d-ebee-5b0c-89e6-af072a20920b" :answer-field/